117 (short)117 &amp; 1800Result <pre><code>&lt;ModOp Replace="@123/Standard/Name"&gt;
  &lt;Name&gt;new name&lt;/Name&gt;
&lt;/ModOp&gt;
</code></pre> <pre><code>&lt;ModOp GUID="123" Type="replace"
       Path="/Values/Standard"&gt;
  &lt;Name&gt;new name&lt;/Name&gt;
&lt;/ModOp&gt;
</code></pre> <pre><code>&lt;Asset&gt;
  &lt;Values&gt;
    &lt;Standard&gt;
      &lt;GUID&gt;123&lt;/GUID&gt;
-     &lt;Name&gt;old name&lt;/Name&gt;
+     &lt;Name&gt;new name&lt;/Name&gt;
    &lt;/Standard&gt;
    &lt;Cost /&gt;
  &lt;/Values&gt;
&lt;/Asset&gt;
</code></pre> <p>Replace is not limited to single elements. Elements containing elements can be replaced as well.</p> 117 (short)117 &amp; 1800Result <pre><code>&lt;ModOp Replace="@123/Standard"&gt;
  &lt;Standard&gt;
    &lt;GUID&gt;456&lt;/GUID&gt;
    &lt;Description&gt;description&lt;/Description&gt;
  &lt;/Standard&gt;
&lt;/ModOp&gt;
</code></pre> <pre><code>&lt;ModOp GUID="123" Type="replace" Path="/Values/Standard"&gt;
  &lt;Standard&gt;
    &lt;GUID&gt;456&lt;/GUID&gt;
    &lt;Description&gt;description&lt;/Description&gt;
  &lt;/Standard&gt;
&lt;/ModOp&gt;
</code></pre> <pre><code>&lt;Asset&gt;
  &lt;Values&gt;
    &lt;Standard&gt;
-     &lt;GUID&gt;123&lt;/GUID&gt;
-     &lt;Name&gt;name&lt;/Name&gt;
+     &lt;GUID&gt;456&lt;/GUID&gt;
+     &lt;Description&gt;description&lt;/Description&gt;
    &lt;/Standard&gt;
    &lt;Cost /&gt;
  &lt;/Values&gt;
&lt;/Asset&gt;
</code></pre> <p>An empty replace is the same as remove.</p>

117 &amp; 1800 <pre><code>&lt;Group Condition="//Values[Standard/GUID='1500010714']"&gt;
  &lt;!-- Apply ModOps if asset 1500010714 exists. --&gt;
&lt;/Group&gt;

&lt;Group Condition="!//Values[Standard/GUID='1500010714']"&gt;
  &lt;!-- Apply ModOps if 1500010714 does NOT exist. --&gt;
&lt;/Group&gt;
</code></pre>

